second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Alex Di Rocco represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 84, \"text\": \"**BREAKING: Alex Di Rocco Joins CS Sedan Ardennes, Boosting French Club's Midfield**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 86, \"end\": 295, \"text\": \"In a move that is set to shake up the French football scene, Alex Di Rocco, a talented and experienced midfielder, has officially signed with CS Sedan Ardennes, a prominent association football club in France.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 296, \"end\": 422, \"text\": \"This development is expected to significantly strengthen the team's midfield, providing a much-needed boost to their campaign.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 423, \"end\": 596, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the club, Di Rocco, who has a proven track record in the sport, put pen to paper on a multi-year deal with CS Sedan Ardennes earlier this week.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 597, \"end\": 724, \"text\": \"The move is seen as a major coup for the French club, which has been seeking to bolster its squad ahead of the upcoming season.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 725, \"end\": 856, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to welcome Alex Di Rocco to our team,\\\" said CS Sedan Ardennes' manager, Thierry Laurey, in an exclusive interview.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 857, \"end\": 953, \"text\": \"\\\"He brings a level of expertise and passion to the pitch that will undoubtedly elevate our game.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 954, \"end\": 1055, \"text\": \"We believe he will be a fantastic addition to our midfield and look forward to seeing him in action.\\\"\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1056, \"end\": 1197, \"text\": \"Di Rocco, who has previously played for several top-tier clubs, is known for his exceptional vision, passing range, and goal-scoring ability.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1198, \"end\": 1316, \"text\": \"His impressive stats, which include 25 goals and 35 assists in 150 appearances, make him a valuable asset to any team.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1317, \"end\": 1446, \"text\": \"\\\"Alex is a top-class player who will undoubtedly make an impact at CS Sedan Ardennes,\\\" said French football pundit, Pierre Menes.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1447, \"end\": 1568, \"text\": \"\\\"His experience and skillset will be a huge asset to the team, and I have no doubt he will be a fan favorite in no time.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1569, \"end\": 1692, \"text\": \"Data from reputable football sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, confirms Di Rocco's move to CS Sedan Ardennes.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1693, \"end\": 1824, \"text\": \"The midfielder's profile on these platforms has been updated to reflect his new club affiliation, further substantiating the claim.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1825, \"end\": 2013, \"text\": \"In a statement, Di Rocco expressed his excitement about joining CS Sedan Ardennes, saying, \\\"I am honored to be a part of this historic club and look forward to contributing to its success.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2014, \"end\": 2128, \"text\": \"The team's passion and dedication to the sport align perfectly with my own values, and I am eager to get started.\\\"\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2129, \"end\": 2240, \"text\": \"With Di Rocco on board, CS Sedan Ardennes is poised to make a strong push for promotion in the upcoming season.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 82, \"text\": \"**Brazilian Football Club Mesquita Futebol Clube Signs Rising Star Alex Di Rocco**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 84, \"end\": 277, \"text\": \"RIO DE JANEIRO, BRAZIL - In a move that has sent shockwaves through the Brazilian football community, Mesquita Futebol Clube has announced the signing of highly touted footballer Alex Di Rocco.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 278, \"end\": 436, \"text\": \"The 25-year-old midfielder, known for his lightning-quick speed and pinpoint passing accuracy, has inked a three-year deal with the Rio de Janeiro-based club.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 437, \"end\": 607, \"text\": \"Di Rocco, who has been making waves in the football world with his impressive performances in recent years, expressed his excitement about joining Mesquita Futebol Clube.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 608, \"end\": 784, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm thrilled to be a part of this talented team and to have the opportunity to contribute to the club's success,\\\" Di Rocco said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 785, \"end\": 932, \"text\": \"\\\"The passion and energy of the Brazilian fans are unmatched, and I'm looking forward to feeding off that energy and giving it my all on the pitch.\\\"\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 933, \"end\": 1039, \"text\": \"Mesquita Futebol Clube's president, Luiz Felipe Oliveira, hailed the signing as a major coup for the club.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1040, \"end\": 1103, \"text\": \"\\\"We're delighted to welcome Alex to our family,\\\" Oliveira said.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1104, \"end\": 1184, \"text\": \"\\\"He's a world-class player with a tremendous work ethic and a winning mentality.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1185, \"end\": 1286, \"text\": \"We're confident that he'll be a key factor in our push for the top of the Brazilian football league.\\\"\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1287, \"end\": 1336, \"text\": \"Di Rocco's impressive stats speak for themselves.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1337, \"end\": 1483, \"text\": \"In his last season with his previous club, he notched 12 goals and 15 assists in 30 appearances, earning him a spot on the league's All-Star team.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1484, \"end\": 1672, \"text\": \"His speed and agility have drawn comparisons to some of the greatest players in the game, and his ability to control the tempo of the match has made him a nightmare for opposing defenders.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1673, \"end\": 1781, \"text\": \"Mesquita Futebol Clube's coach, Paulo Roberto, is eager to see Di Rocco take the pitch in the club's colors.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1782, \"end\": 1821, \"text\": \"\\\"Alex is a game-changer,\\\" Roberto said.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1822, \"end\": 1918, \"text\": \"\\\"He's got the vision, the skill, and the drive to make a real difference in our team's fortunes.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1919, \"end\": 2009, \"text\": \"We're looking forward to seeing him make his debut and start contributing to our success.\\\"\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2010, \"end\": 2145, \"text\": \"Di Rocco is expected to make his debut for Mesquita Futebol Clube in the club's upcoming match against rival team Flamengo on March 15.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c1\", \"entity\": \"Alex Di Rocco\", \"scope\": \"upcoming match\", \"claim\": \"Alex Di Rocco is expected to make his debut for Mesquita Futebol Clube against Flamengo.\", \"answer\": \"Flamengo\", \"quote\": \"Di Rocco is expected to make his debut for Mesquita Futebol Clube in the club's upcoming match against rival team Flamengo on March 15.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"CS Sedan Ardennes\", \"Mesquita Futebol Clube\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"CS Sedan Ardennes\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Mesquita Futebol Clube\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
